      },
      "text": "In this article, the G DATA SecurityLabs will have a look at the following topics: an example of the spear phishing campaign, sent only a few days after the malware has been advertised the marketing approach to sell the malware the analysis of some of Kraken’s features theories about why Kraken has been used as malware in a targeted attack",
